SDSS stellar spectra
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
js/data/spectra/**
Derived from four observed spectra served by Data Release 18 of the Sloan
Digital Sky Survey: https://www.sdss.org/dr18/

SDSS states that all data released in its public data releases are considered
in the public domain (https://www.sdss.org/collaboration/image-use-policy/),
so no license comes with these spectra and Gravitas adds none. The CC BY 4.0
stated on the same page covers SDSS images, not its data.

What SDSS asks for is an acknowledgment for the release used and for each
phase of the survey the data came from
(https://www.sdss.org/collaboration/citing-sdss/). One of these spectra was
observed by SEGUE (SDSS-II) and three by SEGUE-2 (SDSS-III), and all four
were retrieved from DR18, the first SDSS-V release, so three apply. Each is
quoted as SDSS publishes it.

